                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "A configuration you would otherwise build by hand is already a component. Input · amount is an input with the currency affix and mono right-aligned digits; Input · search has the leading icon. Drag it and it is done.",
