                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "The two axes are independent in the variable system but not in the product. A 40 px row is a comfortable pointer target and a poor thumb target, so on touch the row height floor is density-row-min-touch at 44 regardless of the density setting. Density is offered on pointer regimes; on Compact the control resolves to comfortable and the setting is hidden rather than shown disabled.",
