                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Orthogonal to variant and state, so it lives outside the matrix rather than multiplying it. Pointer regimes resolve 30 / 36 / 44; Compact resolves 36 / 44 / 52, because a 36 px control is a comfortable mouse target and a poor thumb target. A leading icon is a configuration, not a variant — every variant can take one.",
