                  "fill": "$color-text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Content options any state can carry, so they sit outside the state matrix instead of doubling it. The affix cells are chrome, not content: the currency symbol is never selectable, never deletable, and never part of the value the field returns. An amount configuration also switches the value to mono and right-aligns it, so the decimal sits where it will sit in the ledger below. The leading icon is decorative and never replaces the label or the accessible name.",
