                  "fill": "$color-text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "pen.dev has no variant properties — a component is one object tree and all variation comes from per-instance overrides. So a configuration that people should be able to pick from the Components panel has to be a component. A preset contains an instance of the atom with the overrides baked in; it never redraws the control. One chrome, still one place to change it.",
