                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "The row the product is built around. The leading slot carries merchant identity, because scanning a ledger you look for who, then how much — category is what you filter and verify by, not what you identify by, so it sits in its own aligned column where it can be scanned and sorted. The amount anchors the right edge, mono and decimal-aligned. The row is the hit target; nothing inside competes. Density drives height, cell padding and gaps, so one setting reflows every ledger.",
